        "name": "No, I'm not a Voenkom",
        "steam_appid": 4155010,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/9a39ab944b2c2de6fac659d80f612f45.avif?t=1764335117\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Today was a tough day, as always. The shift supervisor at the factory was scolding you again, saying, &quot;You lazybones, you're not working productively...&quot; How can anyone even work there when half the staff has been laid off and wages haven't been paid for three months? You slowly wander down a snow-covered street, the gloomy five-story panel buildings with their crooked roofs propping up the gray sky... This small town used to be much more prosperous, but then the local steel mill, which provided employment for most of the residents, began to suffer losses. Almost everyone who could work had left, and the city was a pale shadow of its former self. Finally, you entered the building. Yes, it could do with a major renovation, or at least a simple cleaning. You entered your apartment, sat down in a large, soft chair, and instantly fell asleep. This sleep, which had barely begun, was almost immediately interrupted by a knock on the door.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0b9804830ce99f2c9af030b1f6638482.poster.avif?t=1764335117\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0b9804830ce99f2c9af030b1f6638482.webm?t=1764335117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0b9804830ce99f2c9af030b1f6638482.mp4?t=1764335117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/a5de4885f24c28848e3c3e0703ce26be.avif?t=1764335117\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game combines the horror and immersive simulator genres. Gameplay is divided into two phases: In the first phase, you're in your apartment, and various uninvited guests periodically knock on your door. You simply choose whether to let them in. In the second phase, a tense chase awaits you, and you must escape your pursuer and reach the end of the level.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, you wake up to the deafening roar of the doorbell. Who could have shown up at such a late hour? Actually, it could be anyone. Your friends, neighbors, colleagues, or someone else... Your task is to decide whether to let them in. You'll have to make this choice several times throughout the evening. And if you let someone in with ill intentions, you'll have to leave your own home. That certainly won't end well for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/a621ba87681380df27f8275c12edc03f.poster.avif?t=1764335117\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/a621ba87681380df27f8275c12edc03f.webm?t=1764335117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/62dcd8ecc1af41f8292b3584a3dc6111.avif?t=1764335117\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your home's furnishings perfectly match your rugged lifestyle. The last renovation in this apartment was back in the Khrushchev era, but that doesn't bother you at all. Just placing your favorite items around the apartment immediately filled it with warmth and comfort.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0ac8ccc84b0ad0f2d134faf507bfc25c.poster.avif?t=1764335117\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0ac8ccc84b0ad0f2d134faf507bfc25c.webm?t=1764335117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0ac8ccc84b0ad0f2d134faf507bfc25c.mp4?t=1764335117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/9a39ab944b2c2de6fac659d80f612f45.avif?t=1764335117\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Today was a tough day, as always. The shift supervisor at the factory was scolding you again, saying, &quot;You lazybones, you're not working productively...&quot; How can anyone even work there when half the staff has been laid off and wages haven't been paid for three months? You slowly wander down a snow-covered street, the gloomy five-story panel buildings with their crooked roofs propping up the gray sky... This small town used to be much more prosperous, but then the local steel mill, which provided employment for most of the residents, began to suffer losses. Almost everyone who could work had left, and the city was a pale shadow of its former self. Finally, you entered the building. Yes, it could do with a major renovation, or at least a simple cleaning. You entered your apartment, sat down in a large, soft chair, and instantly fell asleep. This sleep, which had barely begun, was almost immediately interrupted by a knock on the door.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0b9804830ce99f2c9af030b1f6638482.poster.avif?t=1764335117\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0b9804830ce99f2c9af030b1f6638482.webm?t=1764335117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0b9804830ce99f2c9af030b1f6638482.mp4?t=1764335117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/a5de4885f24c28848e3c3e0703ce26be.avif?t=1764335117\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game combines the horror and immersive simulator genres. Gameplay is divided into two phases: In the first phase, you're in your apartment, and various uninvited guests periodically knock on your door. You simply choose whether to let them in. In the second phase, a tense chase awaits you, and you must escape your pursuer and reach the end of the level.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, you wake up to the deafening roar of the doorbell. Who could have shown up at such a late hour? Actually, it could be anyone. Your friends, neighbors, colleagues, or someone else... Your task is to decide whether to let them in. You'll have to make this choice several times throughout the evening. And if you let someone in with ill intentions, you'll have to leave your own home. That certainly won't end well for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/a621ba87681380df27f8275c12edc03f.poster.avif?t=1764335117\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/a621ba87681380df27f8275c12edc03f.webm?t=1764335117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/62dcd8ecc1af41f8292b3584a3dc6111.avif?t=1764335117\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your home's furnishings perfectly match your rugged lifestyle. The last renovation in this apartment was back in the Khrushchev era, but that doesn't bother you at all. Just placing your favorite items around the apartment immediately filled it with warmth and comfort.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0ac8ccc84b0ad0f2d134faf507bfc25c.poster.avif?t=1764335117\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0ac8ccc84b0ad0f2d134faf507bfc25c.webm?t=1764335117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155010/extras/0ac8ccc84b0ad0f2d134faf507bfc25c.mp4?t=1764335117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "You're an ordinary factory worker, whiling away your dreary life in a nondescript small town. You had a stable job, your own apartment, mortgaged at just 89% interest, and everything was going well, until one gloomy evening, an uninvited guest knocked on your door...",
